"""Sanic Blueprint exposing A2A JSON-RPC routes on the main Rasa server.

The SDK's JSON-RPC app is Starlette. This module keeps the Sanic routes and
follows ``JsonRpcDispatcher``: native 1.0 methods are parsed with protobuf,
v0.3 method names go through ``RequestHandler03``, and both call the same
``DefaultRequestHandler`` (``RasaA2ARequestHandler``). Bearer auth, the 10 MB
cap, SSE, and the agent card paths are unchanged from the pre-1.0 Sanic layer.

Route layout (registered at root, no URL prefix):
  POST /                            — A2A JSON-RPC endpoint
  GET  /.well-known/agent-card.json — public AgentCard
  GET  /.well-known/agent.json      — deprecated AgentCard alias
"""

